### Peticiones de ejemplo para el cliente HTTP de Visual Studio
@baseUrl = https://localhost:7180

### 1. Token de administrador (emisor local de desarrollo)
# @name adminLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userName": "admin",
  "password": "{{$dotenv ADMIN_PASSWORD}}"
}

### 2. Token de usuario de chat
# @name userLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userName": "user",
  "password": "{{$dotenv USER_PASSWORD}}"
}

### 3. Subir un documento (rol Admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/documents/upload
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=DocuAIBoundary

--DocuAIBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="manual.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./samples/manual.pdf
--DocuAIBoundary--

### 4. Listar documentos (rol Admin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/documents?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### 4b. Listar con filtros: nombre, varios estados, rango de fechas [desde, hasta) y orden
# @name listFiltered
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/documents?search=manual&status=Processed&status=Failed&uploadedFrom=2026-10-01T00:00:00%2B02:00&uploadedTo=2026-11-01T00:00:00%2B01:00&sortBy=FileName&sortDirection=Asc&page=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### 4c. Estado de un documento (polling tras la subida; misma URL que la cabecera Location)
@documentId = {{listFiltered.response.body.$.items[0].id}}
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/documents/{{documentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### 4d. Eliminar un documento y sus fragmentos (204; 409 si se está procesando)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/documents/{{documentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### 4e. Preflight CORS desde el front (debe devolver 204 con Access-Control-Allow-*)
OPTIONS {{baseUrl}}/api/documents
Origin: http://localhost:4200
Access-Control-Request-Method: DELETE
Access-Control-Request-Headers: authorization

### 5. Consulta al chat con streaming SSE (rol User)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/chat/query
Authorization: Bearer {{userLogin.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: text/event-stream

{
  "question": "¿Cuál es el procedimiento para solicitar vacaciones?",
  "topK": 5
}
